# Design System Rules

## Color Palette

### Primary Colors
- `primary-50` - Light background
- `primary-100` - Lighter accent
- `primary-600` - Main brand color
- `primary-700` - Hover states

### Neutral Colors
- `gray-50` - Alternate section backgrounds
- `gray-100` - Subtle borders/dividers
- `gray-200` - Regular borders
- `gray-600` - Body text
- `gray-900` - Headings

### Semantic Colors
- `green-500/600` - Success, completion
- `yellow-50/200` - Warnings, prerequisites
- `red-100/800` - Errors (used sparingly)

## Typography

```typescript
// Headings
<h1 className="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
<h2 className="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">
<h3 className="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">

// Body
<p className="text-gray-600">
<p className="text-sm text-gray-500"> // Small text
```

## Component Patterns

### Cards (Consistent Style)

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Use Card component
import Card from '@/components/ui/Card'

<Card hover className="...">
  <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Title</h3>
  <p className="text-gray-600">Description</p>
</Card>

// ❌ BAD - Complex custom styles
<div className="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transform transition-all...">
```

### Sections

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Consistent section backgrounds
<Section className="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50 to-white">
<Section className="bg-gray-50">
<Section> // White background (default)

// ❌ BAD - Avoid complex gradients
<Section className="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 via-purple-600 to-pink-500">
```

### Buttons

```typescript
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button'

<Button href="/path" size="lg">Primary Action</Button>
<Button href="/path" size="lg" variant="secondary">Secondary</Button>
```

## Dark Mode

**DO NOT USE dark mode classes** - This project uses light mode only.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD - Avoid dark mode
<div className="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">

// ✅ GOOD - Light mode only
<div className="bg-white text-gray-900">
```

## Spacing & Layout

```typescript
// Section padding
<Section> // Built-in consistent padding

// Card padding
<Card className="p-6"> // Standard card padding

// Grid layouts
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
```

## Icons

Use `lucide-react` for consistent iconography:

```typescript
import { BookOpen, Clock, Award } from 'lucide-react'

<BookOpen className="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" />
```

## Hover Effects

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Subtle hover
<Card hover> // Built-in hover effect

// Links
<Link className="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">

// ❌ BAD - Too much transformation
<div className="hover:scale-150 hover:rotate-45 hover:shadow-2xl">
```

## Consistency Checklist

- [ ] Use `Card` component for card layouts
- [ ] Use `primary-*` colors, not `blue-*` or `purple-*`
- [ ] No dark mode classes
- [ ] Icons from `lucide-react`
- [ ] Consistent padding/spacing
- [ ] `text-gray-900` for headings, `text-gray-600` for body
